# Real-handwriting arm: never commit the source dataset, nor anything
# composited from it (extracted real ink, even transformed, is still
# derived from a no-explicit-license third-party work -- see README).
# Only manifest.json (text labels + metadata) is committed for this arm.
eval/real_handwriting/.cache/
eval/real_handwriting/cases/
# Exceptions: evidence for the decide() acceptance-rule correction (see
# README, "Phase 4: held-out test, opened once") -- committed so the
# correction is checkable, not asserted. Everything else under
# eval/real_handwriting/results/ stays gitignored as before.
!eval/real_handwriting/results/h1_nullable_instruction_test.jsonl
!eval/real_handwriting/results/experiment_log.jsonl
